{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>對於經常需要掌握行動裝置網絡使用情況的用戶而言，這款應用能幫助你實時追蹤 WiFi 與蜂窩數據消耗。它提供清晰的用量統計，讓你在數據週期內保持掌控，避免超額費用。目前該 App 終生版限時免費兌換中，原價為 US $9.99。</p>\n\n<h2>全方位數據視覺化管理</h2>\n<p>此工具具備全面的數據追蹤功能，支援查看當前、每小時及每日的使用明細。直觀的圖表能呈現過去數日、週至月的趨勢變化，並可查看 IP 地理位置資訊。搭配主畫面與鎖定螢幕的美觀小部件，以及智能通知提醒，讓你隨時掌握流量狀況，無需頻繁開啟應用即可獲取關鍵洞察。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/320x480bb-5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/320x480bb-6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/320x480bb-7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/320x480bb-8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/320x480bb-9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/320x480bb-10.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費兌換終生版</h2>\n<p>Network Usage Monitor 終生版限時免費中，用戶透過兌換連結領取，注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。兌換連結數目有限，額滿即止。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5457\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_5457-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5456 1\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_5456-1-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Network Usage Monitor</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>兌換位置：App Store （額滿即止）</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T21:57:46.838466+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":412,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}